   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2006-09-05** (recommended): source not stated; 6 songs; 34 min [1]. Said about its sound: Taper calls the sound okay but somewhat boomy, still very listenable; the first two songs, Dancefloors and What a Wonderful Man, are missing [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- My Morning Jacket were supporting Pearl Jam at this show; the taper remembers it fondly as an early recording with decent gear [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2006-09-05**: taped by j.mart; source: AT943's (C) > SP-SPSB-6 (bass roll-off @ 107Hz) > JB3 (+6dB Gain, WAV 16bit/44kHz) [1]",
